title: Kanas/module invalidity
doc:
- audience:
  - Node Dev
  - Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    # Description

    This PR implements refined, descriptive module-specific invalidity support for transactions. It introduces a dedicated `ModuleInvalidity` struct to separate transaction validation reasons from execution-time dispatch errors. The `InvalidTransaction` enum is extended with a new `Module(ModuleInvalidity)` variant, enabling pallets to return per-module error numbers when a transaction is rejected during the validation phase.

crates:
- name: sc-rpc-api
  bump: minor
- name: sc-rpc-spec-v2
  bump: minor
- name: sp-runtime
  bump: major
